<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY SEVEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRENCH OPEN MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY SEVEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results on the</p>
<p>seventh day of the French Open tennis tournament on Sunday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>Fourth round:</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Mark Philippoussis</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-2 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) vs Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 7-5 1-6</p>
<p>2-6 6-1 2-2 play stopped due to bad light</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat 15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat 8-Alex Corretja (Spain) 5-7 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>(Ends men's results)</p>
</text>
